<title>UK: Landesgirokasse sets 3.0 bln Luf bond.</title>
<headline>Landesgirokasse sets 3.0 bln Luf bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg, Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, Generale Bank and Credit Commmunal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESGIROKASSE</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    13.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  73.90     PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.03 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    PRAECIPUUM  0.175</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
